      "6.5. Collection of Information: OPA, LDC and Ontario ministries may need info such as property identification information, property zoning, GST number, and information to establish that the Supplier is an Eligible Participant (domestic content reference removed).\\nDisclosure of Information: OPA may disclose to LDC and the Ministry of Energy, and certain other Ontario ministries certain information ... including without limitation, Supplier’s name, facility location, microFIT Program eligibility characteristics, Supplier’s electricity generation, pricing and payments (domestic content reference removed).\\nAdditional language: 'The OPA may disclose certain information... to other government ministries, agencies, institutions or organizations, for purposes of promoting public health and safety and allowing emergency services personnel, as well as other public officials to plan and respond properly in the event of an emergency.'\\nConsent: Supplier consents to collection, use and disclosure/sharing per OPA's Privacy Policy (substantively same, but disclosure scope broadened).",
