      :impact
      "Major — increases the scope of permitted disclosures, potentially exposing Supplier data to more government recipients and for additional purposes (emergency planning/public safety). This may raise privacy/compliance concerns under FIPPA and requires internal privacy controls and Supplier notification/consent processes."}
